{"id":"1eb6b14c0b3fd700","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-vertex-cover-language.md","title":"顶点覆盖判定语言","display":"df-vertex-cover-language — 顶点覆盖判定语言","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-vertex-cover-language","aliases":["73-df-vertex-cover-language"],"display":"df-vertex-cover-language — 顶点覆盖判定语言","depends_on":["[[73-df-finite-graph-binary-coding]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§10.4.3, print pp. 463–464; PDF pp. 485–486","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":10},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-vertex-cover-language"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-vertex-cover-language</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-vertex-cover-language — 顶点覆盖判定语言"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4f6d4d247465f3c9\" href=\"?note=4f6d4d247465f3c9\" title=\"73-df-finite-graph-binary-coding\">73-df-finite-graph-binary-coding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§10.4.3, print pp. 463–464; PDF pp. 485–486"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"10"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UGraph}(n,E)\">\\(\\operatorname{UGraph}(n,E)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq V_n\">\\(S\\subseteq V_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cover}_{n,E}(S)\\Longleftrightarrow S\\subseteq V_n\\land\\forall e\\in E\\;e\\cap S\\ne\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Cover}_{n,E}(S)\\Longleftrightarrow S\\subseteq V_n\\land\\forall e\\in E\\;e\\cap S\\ne\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{VC}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{GI}^U(n,E,k):\\operatorname{UGraph}(n,E)\\land\n\\exists S\\subseteq V_n\\;(\\operatorname{Cover}_{n,E}(S)\\land|S|\\le k)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{VC}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{GI}^U(n,E,k):\\operatorname{UGraph}(n,E)\\land\n\\exists S\\subseteq V_n\\;(\\operatorname{Cover}_{n,E}(S)\\land|S|\\le k)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应教材的 Node Cover（NC）。采用 VC 记号以避免和电路复杂度类 NC 混淆；本地包括 k≥n 的平凡真输入。空图以空集覆盖。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-finite-graph-binary-coding","status":"resolved","id":"4f6d4d247465f3c9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-graph-binary-coding]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{UGraph}(n,E)","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq V_n","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Cover}_{n,E}(S)\\Longleftrightarrow S\\subseteq V_n\\land\\forall e\\in E\\;e\\cap S\\ne\\varnothing.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{VC}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{GI}^U(n,E,k):\\operatorname{UGraph}(n,E)\\land\n\\exists S\\subseteq V_n\\;(\\operatorname{Cover}_{n,E}(S)\\land|S|\\le k)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1242,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-268","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-vertex-cover-language|顶点覆盖判定语言]] （本轮新建）"},{"id":"ecdf039ac295751f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["4f6d4d247465f3c9"]}